<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices unchanged in quiet dealings.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices unchanged in quiet dealings.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate were steady in quiet dealings, but dealers said prices had a weak undertone. Ammonia values were not available.</p>
<p>		     Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172-174		 unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  186-188		 unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		na			nc</p>
<p>(na - not available, nc - no comparison)</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
